msgstr "Where the button leads: a page of the site, an external address or mailto:, with the placeholders {arrivo} and {partenza} (YYYY-MM-DD), {notti}, {ospiti} and {totale}. With an #anchor it leads to the form on the same page. Empty: no button, the summary stays."

