msgstr "In an archive template (a category with its subcategories, a tag, an author, the blog, the search) the grid shows the content of that page; with the Pagination tile the pages turn. The number, the order and the look of the grid stay; type and meta filter are not needed here. In the builder, outside an archive, you see the latest content."

#: src/components/Builder/DynamicQueryPanel.vue
